sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PC as "PC fwtransport"
    participant ROM as "BootROM Receiver"
    participant SRAM as "SRAM"
    participant BURN as "Burner Receiver"
    participant STAGE as "Immutable Staging"
    participant FLASH as "Target Flash"

    Note over PC,ROM: Session 1：ROM 只接收 Burner；每帧 Header CRC + Payload CRC
    PC->>ROM: HELLO(role=BOOTROM, session=R, seq=0)
    ROM-->>PC: ACK(seq=0)
    PC->>ROM: ROM_BEGIN_IMAGE(Descriptor + Signature)
    ROM-->>PC: ACK
    loop offset 从 0 连续递增
        PC->>ROM: ROM_IMAGE_DATA(offset, <=1024 B)
        ROM->>SRAM: 写 load_addr + offset，并累计 CRC/SHA
        ROM-->>PC: ACK；ACK 丢失时允许相同帧幂等重传
    end
    PC->>ROM: ROM_END_IMAGE
    ROM->>ROM: 验证长度、CRC、SHA、Ed25519、Chip ID、rollback
    ROM-->>PC: ACK
    PC->>ROM: ROM_EXECUTE
    ROM-->>PC: ACK
    ROM->>BURN: ACK 发出后清 Cache、fence.i、跳转 Burner

    Note over PC,BURN: Session 2：Burner 接收完整 Bundle；使用新的 session=B
    PC->>BURN: HELLO(role=BURNER, session=B, seq=0)
    BURN-->>PC: ACK
    PC->>BURN: BUNDLE_BEGIN(total_size + Package Header)
    BURN->>STAGE: 创建固定大小的 staging 快照
    BURN-->>PC: ACK
    loop package_offset 从 128 连续递增
        PC->>BURN: BUNDLE_DATA(package_offset, <=1024 B)
        BURN->>STAGE: 写入对应 package_offset
        BURN-->>PC: ACK
    end
    PC->>BURN: BUNDLE_END
    BURN->>STAGE: Finalize；禁止 Host/DMA 再修改
    BURN-->>PC: ACK
    PC->>BURN: BUNDLE_INSTALL
    BURN->>BURN: 验证包级 Manifest、全部对象、签名、目标区和擦除计划
    BURN->>FLASH: 写 Payload、回读，再写 FIMG/Commit-last
    BURN-->>PC: ACK(PROGRAM_SUCCESS)
    BURN->>ROM: 请求 Cold Reset，重新进入正常启动链

    Note over PC,BURN: session 不匹配、乱序或 CRC 错误返回 NACK(expected_seq,status)；安全认证失败后不得擦除活动区
